  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nYour Private Retreat on 976m²\r\n\r\nTucked away from the street and surrounded by established greenery, this north-facing home offers something increasingly hard to find – privacy, sunshine, and plenty of space for the whole family to enjoy.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 976m² freehold section (more or less), this tidy home features three bedrooms, a family bathroom, separate guest toilet and laundry, with open-plan living that flows naturally outdoors.\r\n\r\nWith two sun-soaked decks and a spacious garden, outdoor living is a real highlight. Imagine starting your morning with a coffee and birdsong, enjoying an afternoon BBQ with friends, or simply watching the kids play while you unwind in your own peaceful retreat.\r\n\r\nAdding to the appeal are three separate sheds, currently used as an art gallery, a home office and garden storage. Whether you need a creative space, a teenage hangout or somewhere to work from home, there's plenty of flexibility.\r\n\r\nFor those with an eye for potential, move in and enjoy the home as it is, modernise it over time, or explore future subdivision possibilities, subject to council approval and due diligence. Parking is well catered for with a single carport plus ample off-street parking for additional vehicles or even the boat.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the location, with Glamorgan School and Kindergarten within walking distance, and zoning for Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Torbay Village and local amenities are close by, while beautiful Long Bay Beach is approximately a 20-minute easy jog away.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendors are ready for their next chapter and prepared to meet the market.\r\n\r\nIf sunshine, privacy and room to grow are on your wish list, this could be the one! We look forward to seeing you at the open homes!",
